<% instructions = PasswordResetInstructions.new(@token) %>
<%# Canonical fields: reset_password_token, password, password_confirmation. %>
<h1>Password reset requested</h1>

<p>This service is API-only and does not provide a browser password-reset form.</p>
<p>Use this reset token with <code>PUT /users/password</code>.</p>

<p><strong>Reset token:</strong><br><code><%= instructions.token %></code></p>

<p><strong>Content-Type: application/json</strong></p>
<p>JSON payload:</p>
<pre><code><%= instructions.payload_json %></code></pre>

<p>curl example:</p>
<pre><code><%= instructions.curl_command %></code></pre>

<p>If you did not request this password reset, ignore this email.</p>
